.TH REGOLITH-DISPLAYD-INIT 1 "2026-08-09" "regolith-displayd 0.3.4" "User Commands"
.SH NAME
regolith-displayd-init \- initialise the Regolith kanshi configuration
.SH SYNOPSIS
.B regolith-displayd-init
.SH DESCRIPTION
.B regolith-displayd-init
creates the Regolith kanshi profile directory and configuration file when
they do not exist.  The default directory is
.B ~/.config/regolith3/kanshi;
set
.B REGOLITH_KANSHI_DIR
to use another directory.
.PP
When the profile directory is empty, the command creates a dummy profile so
that
.B kanshi
can start before a real display profile has been configured.
